{"id":"91b637dbdbd7a2c3","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-oblivious-tm.md","title":"Oblivious Turing Machine","display":"df-oblivious-tm — Oblivious Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-oblivious-tm","aliases":["28-df-oblivious-tm","Oblivious Turing Machine"],"display":"df-oblivious-tm — Oblivious Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-computation]]","[[28-df-configuration-transition]]"],"source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"18,34","source_pdf_pages":"44,60"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-oblivious-tm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-oblivious-tm</span><span>Oblivious Turing Machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oblivious-tm — Oblivious Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"18,34"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"44,60"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=k_M\">\\(k=k_M\\)</span>；初始配置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^0_{M,x}\">\\(C^0_{M,x}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a>，一步关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(C)\">\\(q(C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i_j(C)\">\\(i_j(C)\\)</span> 分别为配置的状态和第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 个头位置投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le j\\le k\">\\(0\\le j\\le k\\)</span>。下式按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 定义停机后吸收延拓的执行和头位置函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C^{t+1}_{M,x}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}C^t_{M,x}&amp;q(C^t_{M,x})\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\},\\\\\\iota C^\\prime\\;\\operatorname{Step}_M(C^t_{M,x},C^\\prime)&amp;q(C^t_{M,x})\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\},\\end{cases}\\qquad h_{M,j}(x,t)\\coloneqq i_j(C^t_{M,x}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C^{t+1}_{M,x}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}C^t_{M,x}&amp;q(C^t_{M,x})\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\},\\\\\\iota C^\\prime\\;\\operatorname{Step}_M(C^t_{M,x},C^\\prime)&amp;q(C^t_{M,x})\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\},\\end{cases}\\qquad h_{M,j}(x,t)\\coloneqq i_j(C^t_{M,x}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Obl}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n,t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}\\;h_{M,j}(x,t)=h_{M,j}(y,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Obl}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n,t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}\\;h_{M,j}(x,t)=h_{M,j}(y,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>包含只读输入头，且明确停机后的观测约定。此延拓不是新增 Step 边，不影响运行时间定义。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Exercise 1.5，印刷 p.34 / PDF p.60。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-transition","status":"resolved","id":"6b648ff230619ba2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$k=k_M$；初始配置 $C^0_{M,x}$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]，一步关系 $\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 见 [[28-df-configuration-transition]]。$q(C)$、$i_j(C)$ 分别为配置的状态和第 $j$ 个头位置投影；$0\\le j\\le k$。下式按 $t\\in\\mathbb N$ 定义停机后吸收延拓的执行和头位置函数。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-transition","status":"resolved","id":"6b648ff230619ba2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$k=k_M$；初始配置 $C^0_{M,x}$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]，一步关系 $\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 见 [[28-df-configuration-transition]]。$q(C)$、$i_j(C)$ 分别为配置的状态和第 $j$ 个头位置投影；$0\\le j\\le k$。下式按 $t\\in\\mathbb N$ 定义停机后吸收延拓的执行和头位置函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"k=k_M","display":false},{"tex":"C^0_{M,x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step}_M","display":false},{"tex":"q(C)","display":false},{"tex":"i_j(C)","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le j\\le k","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"C^{t+1}_{M,x}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}C^t_{M,x}&q(C^t_{M,x})\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\},\\\\\\iota C^\\prime\\;\\operatorname{Step}_M(C^t_{M,x},C^\\prime)&q(C^t_{M,x})\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\},\\end{cases}\\qquad h_{M,j}(x,t)\\coloneqq i_j(C^t_{M,x}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Obl}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n,t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\forall j\\in\\{0,\\ldots,k\\}\\;h_{M,j}(x,t)=h_{M,j}(y,t).","display":true}],"bytes":1653,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"通用与标准化机器：[[28-df-universal-tm]]、[[28-df-oblivious-tm]]、[[28-thm-oblivious-simulation]]。"},{"id":"71205f67d1e76729","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$t\\in\\mathrm{TC}$，see [[28-df-time-constructible]]。对所有 $x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$ 有 $\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le t(|x|)$。输出/时间与无知觉性来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]、[[28-df-oblivious-tm]]。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","256220eba4eba968","6b648ff230619ba2"]}